  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Scope 决定可见性",
      "items": [
        "forWorkspace 预置 .ai4j/skills + .agents/skills；includeDefaultSkillRoots=false 默认不带进程级根——服务端租户不会意外暴露全局 Skill",
        "enabledSkillNames 过滤 discovered；providedSkills 代码直供与磁盘发现按名合并去重"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "两条激活通道",
      "items": [
        "automatic（可模型调用且未 disableModelInvocation）：appendAvailableSkillsPrompt 把 Skill 索引写进 systemPrompt，模型经 read_skill_file 按需读正文",
        "selected（request.selectedSkills 显式指定）：SkillPromptOverlayMemory 包一层 memory 直接注入完整内容——≤48KB/12K 字符截断"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "读取被限定在 Skill 根",
      "items": [
        "createSkillToolContext(skillRoots) 生成 BuiltInToolContext，read_skill_file 只能读 Skill 目录内文件",
        "工具名冲突时注册别名并加装 toolInterceptor 改写调用名；无函数工具能力的 runtime 只保留 selected 通道",
        "Coding 侧 CodingSkillDiscovery.discoverDefault(root, dirs) 把 allowedReadRoots + availableSkills 写回 WorkspaceContext"
      ]
    }
  ]
